    {"id":"history-events","label":"History and events","records":["wars","treaties","revolutions","elections","economic crises","technological transitions","foundings","dissolutions","migrations"],"measurements":["date","duration","participants","casualties when sourced","economic effect","territorial effect"],"edges":["caused","preceded","followed","involved","transformed","triggered"]},
    {"id":"people-organizations","label":"People and organizations","records":["politicians","scientists","business leaders","writers","religious figures","activists","companies","NGOs","universities","foundations"],"measurements":["birth/founding","roles","affiliations","jurisdiction","assets when public","leadership"],"edges":["founded","leads","works-for","owns","advises","affiliated-with","funds","influences"]},
    {"id":"north-programme","label":"European Economic Graph / North Programme","records":["countries","sectors","fiscal systems","energy corridors","industrial clusters","infrastructure corridors","strategic dependencies","policy proposals"],"measurements":["debt/GDP","deficit/GDP","energy dependency","trade concentration","industrial capacity","investment","productivity"],"edges":["anchor","connects","depends-on","reduces-risk-through","invests-in","coordinates-with"],"guardrail":"Policy recommendations are kept separate from observed facts and attributed to the framework."},
    {"id":"potatoism","label":"Potatoism and project mythology","records":["symbols","characters","events","cosmology","lexicon","timeline","comparative motifs","creative texts"],"measurements":["timeline","internal relationships","textual recurrence"],"edges":["symbolizes","transforms-into","contains","parallels","contrasts-with"],"guardrail":"Project canon and interpretation are never represented as empirical fact."}
  ],
  "promotion_pipeline":["candidate","researched","sourced","normalized","relationship-linked","canonical","routed","audited"],
  "minimum_record_standard":{"identity":true,"description":true,"type":true,"layer":true,"geography":"when applicable","timeline":"when applicable","source":"for empirical claims","uncertainty":"when estimates or disputed classifications exist","relationships":"at least one where meaningful"},
  "missing_data_policy":"Explicitly mark not-researched, researched-missing and not-applicable. Never substitute zero for unknown.",
  "relationship_policy":"Every major empirical record should participate in the graph where a meaningful relationship exists; isolated nodes are research debt unless isolation is itself meaningful.",
  "quality_gate":["valid JSON","stable IDs","no duplicate canonical IDs","relationship endpoints resolve","sources are attributable","classification is explicit","estimates are dated","routes resolve","manifest updated","audit passes"]
}
